<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1297498908"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1413528456"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Walk Thru Fire"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Vicetone / Meron Ryan"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Walk Thru Fire"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:14.483"><div begin="00:08.717" end="03:10.677"><p begin="00:08.717" end="00:10.333" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">Talk to me<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向我倾诉吧</span></p><p begin="00:12.743" end="00:16.485" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">Spill the secrets you've been keepin'<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">吐露你埋藏于心底的秘密</span></p><p begin="00:16.982" end="00:18.839" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">Life cuts deep<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">生活纵然布满荆棘</span></p><p begin="00:21.109" end="00:24.506" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">Let me help pick up the pieces<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但请让我助你重新振作</span></p><p begin="00:24.506" end="00:26.589" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">You're not alone, I'm by your side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会不离不弃 你不会再感孤独</span></p><p begin="00:26.837" end="00:28.152" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">Don't you know, don't you know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难道你还不清楚 还不明白</span></p><p begin="00:28.152" end="00:30.018" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">I'll walk through fire with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿与你并肩 跨越刀山火海</span></p><p begin="00:30.200" end="00:31.685" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">I'll walk through fire<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿为你赴汤蹈火</span></p><p begin="00:32.788" end="00:34.885" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">No matter what, I'll make it right<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使误入歧路 我也会重回正轨</span></p><p begin="00:35.120" end="00:36.402" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">Don't you know, don't you know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难道你还不清楚 还不明白</span></p><p begin="00:36.402" end="00:38.285" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">I'll walk through fire with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿与你并肩 跨越刀山火海</span></p><p begin="00:38.453" end="00:40.013" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">I'll walk through fire<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿为你赴汤蹈火</span></p><p begin="00:40.306" end="00:43.691" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">I'm not an angel, I'm not a saint<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我并非至善的天使 也非慈爱的圣人</span></p><p begin="00:44.506" end="00:48.085" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">I've been a closed book full of mistakes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却如那死不悔改重蹈覆辙的笨蛋</span></p><p begin="00:48.583" end="00:52.119" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">But when you're broken, when you're in pain<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你心碎欲绝 痛苦不堪时</span></p><p begin="00:52.685" end="00:56.074" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">Ooh, ooh</p><p begin="00:56.074" end="00:58.354" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">I'll walk through fire with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿与你并肩 跨越刀山火海</span></p><p begin="01:04.357" end="01:05.839" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">I'll walk through fire<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿为你赴汤蹈火</span></p><p begin="01:08.485" end="01:10.775" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">I'll walk through fire with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿与你并肩 跨越刀山火海</span></p><p begin="01:12.591" end="01:14.157" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">I'll walk through fire<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿为你赴汤蹈火</span></p><p begin="01:14.898" end="01:16.930" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">You know I<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你知道我</span></p><p begin="01:19.047" end="01:22.526" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">Don't pretend to be a savior<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不会假装自己能够拯救你于水火</span></p><p begin="01:22.958" end="01:26.849" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">But let me in, yeah<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但请让我进驻你的心</span></p><p begin="01:27.092" end="01:30.689" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">I promise nobody can break us<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我发誓 没有人能够分开我们</span></p><p begin="01:30.689" end="01:32.825" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">You're not alone, I'm by your side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会不离不弃 你不会再感孤独</span></p><p begin="01:33.041" end="01:34.324" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">Don't you know, don't you know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难道你还不清楚 还不明白</span></p><p begin="01:34.324" end="01:36.175" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">I'll walk through fire with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿与你并肩 跨越刀山火海</span></p><p begin="01:36.393" end="01:37.876" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">I'll walk through fire<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿为你赴汤蹈火</span></p><p begin="01:38.959" end="01:41.092" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">No matter what, I'll make it right<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使误入歧路 我也会重回正轨</span></p><p begin="01:41.343" end="01:42.609" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">Don't you know, don't you know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难道你还不清楚 还不明白</span></p><p begin="01:42.609" end="01:44.494" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">I'll walk through fire with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿与你并肩 跨越刀山火海</span></p><p begin="01:44.676" end="01:46.177" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">I'll walk through fire<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿为你赴汤蹈火</span></p><p begin="01:46.537" end="01:49.900" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">I'm not an angel, I'm not a saint<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我并非至善的天使 也非慈爱的圣人</span></p><p begin="01:50.655" end="01:54.289" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">I've been a closed book full of mistakes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却如那死不悔改重蹈覆辙的笨蛋</span></p><p begin="01:54.772" end="01:58.240" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">But when you're broken, when you're in pain<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你心碎欲绝 痛苦不堪时</span></p><p begin="01:58.905" end="02:02.255" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">Ooh, ooh</p><p begin="02:02.255" end="02:04.506" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">I'll walk through fire with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿与你并肩 跨越刀山火海</span></p><p begin="02:06.387" end="02:08.654" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">I'll walk through fire with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿与你并肩 跨越刀山火海</span></p><p begin="02:10.539" end="02:12.041" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">I'll walk through fire<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿为你赴汤蹈火</span></p><p begin="02:14.673" end="02:16.923" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">I'll walk through fire with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿与你并肩 跨越刀山火海</span></p><p begin="02:18.841" end="02:20.998" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">I'll walk through fire with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿与你并肩 跨越刀山火海</span></p><p begin="02:28.655" end="02:30.757" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">You're not alone, I'm by your side<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会不离不弃 你不会再感孤独</span></p><p begin="02:30.991" end="02:32.274" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">Don't you know, don't you know<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">难道你还不清楚 还不明白</span></p><p begin="02:32.274" end="02:34.125" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">I'll walk through fire with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿与你并肩 跨越刀山火海</span></p><p begin="02:34.341" end="02:35.807" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">I'll walk through fire<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿为你赴汤蹈火</span></p><p begin="02:36.160" end="02:39.501" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">I'm not an angel, I'm not a saint<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我并非至善的天使 也非慈爱的圣人</span></p><p begin="02:40.282" end="02:43.938" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">I've been a closed book full of mistakes<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">却如那死不悔改重蹈覆辙的笨蛋</span></p><p begin="02:44.423" end="02:47.922" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">But when you're broken, when you're in pain<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当你心碎欲绝 痛苦不堪时</span></p><p begin="02:48.522" end="02:51.925" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">Ooh, ooh</p><p begin="02:51.925" end="02:54.055" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">I'll walk through fire with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿与你并肩 跨越刀山火海</span></p><p begin="02:56.058" end="02:58.207" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">I'll walk through fire with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿与你并肩 跨越刀山火海</span></p><p begin="03:00.207" end="03:01.674" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">I'll walk through fire<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿为你赴汤蹈火</span></p><p begin="03:04.325" end="03:06.464" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">I'll walk through fire with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿与你并肩 跨越刀山火海</span></p><p begin="03:08.498" end="03:10.677" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">I'll walk through fire with you<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我愿与你并肩 跨越刀山火海</span></p></div></body></tt>